  id: 1
  displayName: Neran
  displayBio: "A crew member of the Artel 12 space mission. Left to his fate and
    forgotten by the US government, he could only count down the seconds until his
    oxygen ran out. His final moments were filled with fear, sorrow, and a burning
    desire for vengeance against those who condemned him to die in the dark void
    of space. A man left alone with death eventually befriends it\u2014and sometimes,
    that friendship bears something terrifying... something that makes us become
    death itself..."
